  message: "Substantive correction: the git-log path in the original Resolution logic section was stale (packages/hypergumbo-tracker/src/hypergumbo_tracker/on_transcript_change.py — that path does not exist in this repo). As written, the script would have returned empty git history and produced empty infra_sha for every entry, silently broken. Corrected to .agent/hooks/_shared/on_transcript_change.py (the actual path, verified 2026-04-08 via Glob). Also added test #4 for the new SHA boundaries introduced by commits 704548fe1 / 7310783e1 / 9ac06cc88 so the resolver is exercised against real v0-window commits. Status remains todo_soft."  # 6946
